<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jop</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jop</para>
  <para style="mt">Jop</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Ana God ere mogl, yagl Jop di pre yegl dugwa, Na dumo makan ere yeiga igne, ene aglo motne? dugwa. Ene nomanen podo panan, na di naro! <verse eid="JOB 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Ana makan gaba siemo siragl mere yenabuka i, ira paduglmedi pitne? dugwa. Te, makan gaba yogwa igne, ira buglo sie yome? dugwa. <verse eid="JOB 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Te, yoba ere mogl, bogl kiglkwa igne, ye bogl mitna yenabedi pika sigwa. Ana makan gaba mitna yenabedi pika aglo sime? dugwa. Te, kobuglo yugu keigwa igne, komono kana kobuglo ta guglo boraiglmara padiglkwa. Makan gaba kobuglomo i, ira paduglme? dugwa. <verse eid="JOB 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Na dumo makan ere yeiga igne i kugl kuri tau abuglage podo sigwa i, giglage akie digo, na angelo kugl neiga mudu gun yedre, aglage kaglkane erimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Creation of Angels" file="FM 002 Creation of Angels_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="38.7">Yawe dumo makan ere yogwa igne, angelo aglage kaglkane erikwa</figure><verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
</usx>